                                                "example_id": "748971bf-2a26-4a6a-8726-f9314cc197ef",
                                                "sense_id": "58858146-a25e-3e61-addb-2cd7b7b0b7ee",
                                                "text": "If I have a diet plan and stick to it, it is easy for me to have control over my middle."
